WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:06.910
His central insight was almost mystical in its plainness.

2
00:00:07.430 --> 00:00:12.570
Drop a protein into water, unfold it with urea, wash the denaturant away, and the

3
00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:18.030
chain finds its way back to exactly one shape, every time, with no template and no

4
00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:19.030
instructions.

5
00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:24.070
The shape was already written in the sequence, selected by the summed push and pull

6
00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:28.850
of hydrogen bonds, hydrophobic burial, and contacts with the surrounding water.

7
00:00:29.530 --> 00:00:31.810
He named it the Thermodynamic Hypothesis.

8
00:00:32.883 --> 00:00:38.923
To the Royal Swedish Academy of Sciences in his 1972 Nobel lecture he put it as one

9
00:00:38.923 --> 00:00:44.043
sentence: "The native conformation is determined by the totality of interatomic

10
00:00:44.043 --> 00:00:48.863
interactions and hence by the amino acid sequence, in a given environment."

11
00:00:49.783 --> 00:00:54.123
Later in life he went looking for philosophical structure, converting to Orthodox

12
00:00:54.123 --> 00:00:57.603
Judaism and becoming a fierce advocate for human rights.

13
00:00:58.223 --> 00:01:02.723
Colleagues said his method never changed: remove the denaturant, and see what

14
00:01:02.723 --> 00:01:03.323
refolds.
